.\r\nDerover med pen og sort blæk, Jeanne Schuffeneckers hånd: \"78bis\"","type":"Påskrift"},{"content":"KKS Melbye-arv (ikke hos Lugt); to gange sort stempel med monogram \"ES\" i rundt blomsterornament (ikke hos Lugt)","type":"Samlermærke"}],"materials":["Ribbet papir"],"object_names":[{"name":"Tegning"}],"production":[{"creator":"Schuffenecker, Claude Emile","creator_forename":"Claude Emile","creator_surname":"Schuffenecker","creator_date_of_birth":"1851-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","creator_date_of_death":"1934-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","creator_nationality":"Fransk","creator_gender":"MALE","creator_lref":"23104_person"}],"production_date":[{"start":"1889-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","end":"1892-12-31T00:00:00.000Z","period":"1889-1892"}],"techniques":["Pastelkridt på ribbet papir. Farveprøver afsat i en bræmme yderst til højre"],"titles":[{"title":"Klipper ved Etretat","type":"beskrivelse","language":"dansk"}],"notes":["Bruun Rasmussens bofortegnelse, nr.367.\r\n\r\nKorrespondance:\r\n-J.nr.75/371. (Brevveksling mellem Erik Fischer og Herbert Melbye 12.10.1975-20.2.1976, samt papirer vedr. arvens overdragelse)"],"number_of_parts":1,"object_history_note":["Claude-Émile Schuffenecker; til dennes søster Jeanne Schuffenecker; Jacques Fouquet, Galerie Les Deux Iles, Paris; herfra 6.12.1966 (?) til Herbert Melbye (1898-1976); herfra til Kobberstiksamlingen 1976 som testamentarisk gave"],"object_number":"KKShm1976-365","object_url":"https://api.smk.dk/api/v1/art?object_number=KKShm1976-365","frontend_url":"https://open.smk.dk/artwork/image/KKShm1976-365","iiif_manifest":"https://api.smk.dk/api/v1/iiif/manifest?id=KKShm1976-365","enrichment_url":"https://enrichment.api.smk.dk/api/enrichment/KKShm1976-365","similar_images_url":"https://similar.api.smk.dk/similar/?object_number=KKShm1976-365","production_dates_notes":["Værkdatering: ca. 1891"],"public_domain":true,"rights":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/","on_display":false,"has_3d_file":false,"has_image":true,"image_width":1600,"image_height":1144,"image_thumbnail":"https://api.smk.dk/api/v1/thumbnail/7420ea00-db83-428d-9081-ef8e02cb1568.jpg","image_native":"https://api.smk.dk/api/v1/thumbnail/7420ea00-db83-428d-9081-ef8e02cb1568.jpg","colors":["#d7eac3","#dfe8a4","#777777","#908d41"],"suggested_bg_color":["#908d41"],"entropy":9.7847805,"contrast":2.5007606,"saturation":1.8091688,"colortemp":3.4078043,"brightness":7.7319546,"artist":["Claude Emile Schuffenecker"]}],"facets":{},"facets_ranges":{},"corrections":[{"impressionism":["impressions","impression","ekspressionisme","impressionnables","passionis","depression","dépression","impresso","professionist","regressions"]}],"suggestion":"impressions","autocomplete":[]}